# Wave W17-U (Route 204): scree post — a scree warning post under the fallen slope: a post carrying one rust-red warning band, the bluff road’s own caution where the slope sheds its stone (design: a falling-rock slope over the road’s north reach). On bluff turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — the fleet’s only warning post: split from every marker post by the red band, which measures nothing and announces nothing — it warns.
